{"seq":1,"slug":"null-safety-patterns","title":"空安全模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/idioms-and-best-practices/null-safety-patterns","wordCount":598,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"空安全模式\">空安全模式</h1><p>空安全是 Kotlin 最核心的语言特性之一。通过类型系统将可空性编码为类型信息，Kotlin 在编译时消除了大部分空指针异常（NPE）。本文介绍 Kotlin 空安全的操作符、模式和防御性编程技巧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>空安全的核心是<strong>把可空性编码进类型系统</strong>：<code>String?</code> 与 <code>String</code> 是不同类型，多数空指针错误在编译期即被拦截。围绕这一区分，安全调用 <code>?.</code>、Elvis <code>?:</code>、非空断言 <code>!!</code> 等操作符负责在两种类型间安全转换，「平台类型」则标记来自 Java 的、可空性未知的边界。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"可空类型系统\">可空类型系统</h2><p>Kotlin 的类型系统区分可空和非空类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val nonNull: String = &quot;hello&quot;   // 不能为 null&#10;val nullable: String? = null     // 可以为 null&#10;&#10;// nonNull = null  // 编译错误&#10;// nullable.length // 编译错误：需要空安全调用\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val nonNull: String = \"hello\"   // 不能为 null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val nullable: String? = null     // 可以为 null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// nonNull = null  // 编译错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// nullable.length // 编译错误：需要空安全调用</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[Kotlin 类型] --&gt; B[&quot;非空类型 String&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;可空类型 String?&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;安全:直接调用方法&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;需要空安全操作符&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;或进行空检查&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[Kotlin 类型] --&gt; B[\"非空类型 String\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"可空类型 String?\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"安全:直接调用方法\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"需要空安全操作符\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"或进行空检查\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心操作符\">核心操作符</h2><h3 id=\"安全调用\">?. 安全调用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val name: String? = fetchName()&#10;val length: Int? = name?.length // name 为 null 时返回 null&#10;&#10;// 链式安全调用&#10;val city: String? = user?.address?.city?.uppercase()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val name: String? = fetchName()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val length: Int? = name?.length // name 为 null 时返回 null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 链式安全调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val city: String? = user?.address?.city?.uppercase()</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"elvis-操作符\">?: Elvis 操作符</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val length: Int = name?.length ?: 0 // name 为 null 时使用默认值&#10;&#10;val displayName = user?.name ?: throw IllegalArgumentException(&quot;用户名不能为空&quot;)&#10;&#10;val config = loadConfig() ?: return // 为 null 时提前返回\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val length: Int = name?.length ?: 0 // name 为 null 时使用默认值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val displayName = user?.name ?: throw IllegalArgumentException(\"用户名不能为空\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val config = loadConfig() ?: return // 为 null 时提前返回</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"非空断言\">!! 非空断言</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val length: Int = name!!.length // 如果 name 为 null，抛出 NPE\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val length: Int = name!!.length // 如果 name 为 null，抛出 NPE</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作符</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>安全性</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>?.</code></td>\n<td>null 时跳过</td>\n<td>✅ 安全</td>\n<td>可选属性访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>?:</code></td>\n<td>null 时使用默认值</td>\n<td>✅ 安全</td>\n<td>提供回退值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>!!</code></td>\n<td>null 时抛 NPE</td>\n<td>❌ 不安全</td>\n<td>仅在确信非空时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 尽量避免使用 <code>!!</code>。如果发现频繁使用，通常意味着类型设计需要改进。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"安全类型转换\">安全类型转换</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val value: Any = &quot;Hello&quot;&#10;&#10;// 不安全转换：失败时抛出 ClassCastException&#10;val str1: String = value as String&#10;&#10;// 安全转换：失败时返回 null&#10;val str2: String? = value as? String&#10;val num: Int? = value as? Int // null，不会抛异常\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val value: Any = \"Hello\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 不安全转换：失败时抛出 ClassCastException</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val str1: String = value as String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 安全转换：失败时返回 null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val str2: String? = value as? String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val num: Int? = value as? Int // null，不会抛异常</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"平台类型\">平台类型</h2><p>来自 Java 的类型在 Kotlin 中表示为&quot;平台类型&quot;（标记为 <code>Type!</code>），编译器不强制空安全检查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// Java 代码&#10;// public String getName() { return null; }&#10;&#10;// Kotlin 中调用&#10;val name: String = javaObj.getName() // 编译通过，但运行时可能 NPE&#10;val safeName: String? = javaObj.getName() // 推荐：显式声明为可空\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Java 代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// public String getName() { return null; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Kotlin 中调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val name: String = javaObj.getName() // 编译通过，但运行时可能 NPE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val safeName: String? = javaObj.getName() // 推荐：显式声明为可空</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Java 注解</th>\n<th>Kotlin 解读</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@NotNull</code></td>\n<td>非空类型 <code>String</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@Nullable</code></td>\n<td>可空类型 <code>String?</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无注解</td>\n<td>平台类型 <code>String!</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 Java 交互边界处，始终显式声明 Kotlin 变量的可空性，不要依赖平台类型的隐式推断。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"空安全模式与惯用法\">空安全模式与惯用法</h2><h3 id=\"模式-1-提前返回\">模式 1：提前返回</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun processUser(user: User?) {&#10;    val name = user?.name ?: return&#10;    val email = user.email ?: return&#10;    sendWelcomeEmail(name, email)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun processUser(user: User?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val name = user?.name ?: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val email = user.email ?: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sendWelcomeEmail(name, email)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模式-2-let-转换\">模式 2：let 转换</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val email: String? = user?.email&#10;&#10;email?.let { nonNullEmail -&gt;&#10;    sendEmail(nonNullEmail)&#10;    logEmailSent(nonNullEmail)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val email: String? = user?.email</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>email?.let { nonNullEmail -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sendEmail(nonNullEmail)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    logEmailSent(nonNullEmail)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模式-3-require-check-断言\">模式 3：require/check 断言</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun createOrder(userId: Long?, productId: Long?) {&#10;    requireNotNull(userId) { &quot;用户 ID 不能为空&quot; }&#10;    requireNotNull(productId) { &quot;商品 ID 不能为空&quot; }&#10;    // 此后 userId 和 productId 都是非空类型&#10;    orderRepository.create(userId, productId)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun createOrder(userId: Long?, productId: Long?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    requireNotNull(userId) { \"用户 ID 不能为空\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    requireNotNull(productId) { \"商品 ID 不能为空\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 此后 userId 和 productId 都是非空类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    orderRepository.create(userId, productId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模式-4-when-smart-cast\">模式 4：when + smart cast</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun describe(value: Any?): String = when (value) {&#10;    null -&gt; &quot;空值&quot;&#10;    is String -&gt; &quot;字符串: $value (长度=${value.length})&quot;&#10;    is Int -&gt; &quot;整数: $value&quot;&#10;    is List&lt;*&gt; -&gt; &quot;列表: ${value.size} 个元素&quot;&#10;    else -&gt; &quot;其他: $value&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun describe(value: Any?): String = when (value) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    null -> \"空值\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is String -> \"字符串: $value (长度=${value.length})\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is Int -> \"整数: $value\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is List&#x3C;*> -> \"列表: ${value.size} 个元素\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else -> \"其他: $value\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[处理可空值] --&gt; B{需要默认值?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[&quot;?: Elvis&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{需要转换?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[&quot;?.let { }&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F{需要断言非空?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[&quot;requireNotNull()&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[&quot;?.安全调用链&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[处理可空值] --&gt; B{需要默认值?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[\"?: Elvis\"]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{需要转换?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[\"?.let { }\"]\n    D --&gt;|否| F{需要断言非空?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[\"requireNotNull()\"]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[\"?.安全调用链\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"空安全构建器\">空安全构建器</h2><p>为集合操作提供空安全的构建器模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun buildUserProfile(user: User?): Map&lt;String, String&gt; = buildMap {&#10;    user?.name?.let { put(&quot;name&quot;, it) }&#10;    user?.email?.let { put(&quot;email&quot;, it) }&#10;    user?.phone?.let { put(&quot;phone&quot;, it) }&#10;    user?.address?.let { addr -&gt;&#10;        addr.city?.let { put(&quot;city&quot;, it) }&#10;        addr.zipCode?.let { put(&quot;zipCode&quot;, it) }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;val emptyList: List&lt;String&gt; = user?.tags?.filterNotNull() ?: emptyList()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun buildUserProfile(user: User?): Map&#x3C;String, String> = buildMap {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    user?.name?.let { put(\"name\", it) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    user?.email?.let { put(\"email\", it) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    user?.phone?.let { put(\"phone\", it) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    user?.address?.let { addr -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        addr.city?.let { put(\"city\", it) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        addr.zipCode?.let { put(\"zipCode\", it) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val emptyList: List&#x3C;String> = user?.tags?.filterNotNull() ?: emptyList()</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"防御性编程策略\">防御性编程策略</h2><h3 id=\"在边界处处理空值\">在边界处处理空值</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// API 层：接收外部数据，严格验证&#10;class UserController {&#10;    fun createUser(request: CreateUserRequest) {&#10;        val name = request.name&#10;            ?: throw BadRequestException(&quot;name 是必填字段&quot;)&#10;        val email = request.email&#10;            ?: throw BadRequestException(&quot;email 是必填字段&quot;)&#10;        userService.create(name, email) // 传入非空值&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 服务层：内部代码，使用非空类型&#10;class UserService {&#10;    fun create(name: String, email: String): User { // 非空参数&#10;        return userRepository.save(User(name = name, email = email))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// API 层：接收外部数据，严格验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UserController {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun createUser(request: CreateUserRequest) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val name = request.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ?: throw BadRequestException(\"name 是必填字段\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val email = request.email</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ?: throw BadRequestException(\"email 是必填字段\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        userService.create(name, email) // 传入非空值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 服务层：内部代码，使用非空类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UserService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun create(name: String, email: String): User { // 非空参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return userRepository.save(User(name = name, email = email))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"集合中的空值处理\">集合中的空值处理</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val mixedList: List&lt;String?&gt; = listOf(&quot;a&quot;, null, &quot;b&quot;, null, &quot;c&quot;)&#10;&#10;val nonNullList: List&lt;String&gt; = mixedList.filterNotNull() // [a, b, c]&#10;val firstNonNull: String = mixedList.filterNotNull().first()&#10;val mappedSafe: List&lt;Int&gt; = mixedList.mapNotNull { it?.length } // [1, 1, 1]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val mixedList: List&#x3C;String?> = listOf(\"a\", null, \"b\", null, \"c\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val nonNullList: List&#x3C;String> = mixedList.filterNotNull() // [a, b, c]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val firstNonNull: String = mixedList.filterNotNull().first()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val mappedSafe: List&#x3C;Int> = mixedList.mapNotNull { it?.length } // [1, 1, 1]</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Kotlin 通过类型系统区分 <strong>可空类型</strong>（<code>T?</code>）和<strong>非空类型</strong>（<code>T</code>），在编译时防止 NPE</li>\n<li><strong><code>?.</code></strong> 安全调用、<strong><code>?:</code></strong> Elvis 操作符是最常用的空安全工具</li>\n<li><strong><code>!!</code></strong> 应尽量避免，频繁使用说明类型设计有问题</li>\n<li><strong>平台类型</strong>来自 Java 互操作，应在边界处显式声明可空性</li>\n<li>常用模式：提前返回（<code>?: return</code>）、let 转换、requireNotNull 断言、when + smart cast</li>\n<li>防御性策略：在 API 边界处验证空值，内部代码使用非空类型</li>\n<li><code>filterNotNull()</code>、<code>mapNotNull()</code> 处理集合中的空值</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"空安全模式","id":"空安全模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可空类型系统","id":"可空类型系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心操作符","id":"核心操作符"},{"level":3,"text":"?. 安全调用","id":"安全调用"},{"level":3,"text":"?: Elvis 操作符","id":"elvis-操作符"},{"level":3,"text":"!! 非空断言","id":"非空断言"},{"level":2,"text":"安全类型转换","id":"安全类型转换"},{"level":2,"text":"平台类型","id":"平台类型"},{"level":2,"text":"空安全模式与惯用法","id":"空安全模式与惯用法"},{"level":3,"text":"模式 1：提前返回","id":"模式-1-提前返回"},{"level":3,"text":"模式 2：let 转换","id":"模式-2-let-转换"},{"level":3,"text":"模式 3：require/check 断言","id":"模式-3-require-check-断言"},{"level":3,"text":"模式 4：when + smart cast","id":"模式-4-when-smart-cast"},{"level":2,"text":"空安全构建器","id":"空安全构建器"},{"level":2,"text":"防御性编程策略","id":"防御性编程策略"},{"level":3,"text":"在边界处处理空值","id":"在边界处处理空值"},{"level":3,"text":"集合中的空值处理","id":"集合中的空值处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"编译器插件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/advanced-features/compiler-plugins"},"next":{"title":"集合操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/idioms-and-best-practices/collection-operations"}}